<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Qantas sees final div likely franked.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Qantas sees final div likely franked.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qantas Airways Ltd said on Wednesday its dividend for the half year to December 31 was likely to be unfranked, but that its final dividend probably would be franked.</p>
</text>
